{
    "title": "AlfredCircle: Family Locator",
    "description": "Introducing AlfredCircle, a brand new app from the team behind AlfredCamera, the beloved home security app with more than 70 million downloads.\r\n\r\nBuilt with your safety in mind, AlfredCircle lets you stay connected with your friends and family. Just add them to your Circle, and you'll get real-time location updates. Get started today and keep your Circles safe!\r\n\r\n\u3010Stay in the Loop with Circles\u3011\r\nInvite your loved ones to join your Circle and share live location updates with each other. Enjoy the peace of mind knowing that:\r\n\u2022 Your kids are safe on their way home from school.\r\n\u2022 Your friends are back safely from a night out.\r\n\u2022 Your elderly mom has reached the grocery store.\r\n\u2022 Your son has boarded his flight without issues.\r\n\u2022 Your partner is on time for dinner.\r\n\u2022 Your brother is on his way with your coffee.\r\n\u2022 And so much more\u2026\r\n\r\n\u3010Get Real-Time Location Alerts with Places\u3011\r\n\u2022 Routine-Based Selection: Select different Places to add to your Circle based on each member\u2019s daily routine.\r\n\u2022 Immediate Notifications: Get notified immediately for arrivals and departures from homes, offices, schools, train stations, and other locations.\r\n\u2022 Peace of Mind: Go about your day knowing your loved ones are safe and sound.\r\n\u2022 Versatile Use: Whether you\u2019re exploring a new city or meeting up with friends at a local coffee shop, add up to 4 Places to your Circle at any time to ensure a smooth experience.\r\n\r\n\u3010Cute and Simple Interface You'll Adore\u3011\r\nAlfredCircle is for everyone. That's why we made sure it's easy to navigate and a breeze to connect, no matter where you are.\r\n\r\nAs they say, sharing is caring. The AlfredCircle family is here to make that happen for you. Download AlfredCircle for free to get started today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing AlfredCircle, a brand new app from the team behind AlfredCamera, the beloved home security app with more than 70 million downloads.<br><br>Built with your safety in mind, AlfredCircle lets you stay connected with your friends and family. Just add them to your Circle, and you&#39;ll get real-time location updates. Get started today and keep your Circles safe!<br><br>\u3010Stay in the Loop with Circles\u3011<br>Invite your loved ones to join your Circle and share live location updates with each other. Enjoy the peace of mind knowing that:<br>\u2022 Your kids are safe on their way home from school.<br>\u2022 Your friends are back safely from a night out.<br>\u2022 Your elderly mom has reached the grocery store.<br>\u2022 Your son has boarded his flight without issues.<br>\u2022 Your partner is on time for dinner.<br>\u2022 Your brother is on his way with your coffee.<br>\u2022 And so much more\u2026<br><br>\u3010Get Real-Time Location Alerts with Places\u3011<br>\u2022 Routine-Based Selection: Select different Places to add to your Circle based on each member\u2019s daily routine.<br>\u2022 Immediate Notifications: Get notified immediately for arrivals and departures from homes, offices, schools, train stations, and other locations.<br>\u2022 Peace of Mind: Go about your day knowing your loved ones are safe and sound.<br>\u2022 Versatile Use: Whether you\u2019re exploring a new city or meeting up with friends at a local coffee shop, add up to 4 Places to your Circle at any time to ensure a smooth experience.<br><br>\u3010Cute and Simple Interface You&#39;ll Adore\u3011<br>AlfredCircle is for everyone. That&#39;s why we made sure it&#39;s easy to navigate and a breeze to connect, no matter where you are.<br><br>As they say, sharing is caring. The AlfredCircle family is here to make that happen for you. Download AlfredCircle for free to get started today!",
